msgstr "Menerapkan profil Cloudflare…"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption Mode"
msgstr "Mode Adopsi"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption can still be useful: it establishes YPerf ownership and enables "
"synchronized Cloudflare purge without rewriting settings that already match."
msgstr ""
"Adopsi tetap berguna: menetapkan kepemilikan YPerf dan memungkinkan purge "
"Cloudflare tersinkron tanpa menulis ulang pengaturan yang sudah sesuai."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption current"
msgstr "Adopsi terkini"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption is a local authority record only. Nginx config, cache files, "
"provider settings and service state remain untouched."
msgstr ""
"Adopsi hanya mencatat otoritas lokal. Konfigurasi Nginx, file cache, "
"pengaturan penyedia, dan status layanan tidak berubah."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
