" otoritas cache halaman yang bersaing."

msgid "The YPerf-owned replacement must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr "Pengganti yang dikelola YPerf harus lulus sebelum migrasi diselesaikan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The Yablonsky AI API key could not be saved. Check the key and server "
"cryptography support."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API Yablonsky AI tidak dapat disimpan. Periksa kunci dan dukungan "
"kriptografi server."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The account API key authenticates optional Yablonsky AI remote compute. It "
"is not a plugin license and never unlocks local YPerf functionality. "
"External requests happen only after an explicit administrator action."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API akun mengautentikasi komputasi jarak jauh Yablonsky AI yang "
"opsional. Kunci ini bukan lisensi plugin dan tidak pernah membuka fungsi "
"lokal YPerf. Permintaan eksternal hanya terjadi setelah tindakan "
"administrator yang eksplisit."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The adopted cache zone is used by more than one Nginx server block. YPerf "
"will not prepare a zone-wide purge path that could affect another site."
msgstr ""
"Zona cache yang diadopsi digunakan oleh lebih dari satu blok server Nginx. "
"YPerf tidak akan menyiapkan jalur purge seluruh zona yang dapat memengaruhi "
"situs lain."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The audit is ready and will keep the 50 most recent semantic invalidation "
"requests."
msgstr "Audit siap dan akan menyimpan 50 permintaan invalidasi semantik terbaru."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The baseline was rolled back after proof detected a failure or confirmed "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"Baseline dibatalkan setelah pembuktian menemukan kegagalan atau regresi "
"terkonfirmasi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
