msgstr ""
"Tombol serah terima terbuka otomatis setelah Langkah 4 membuktikan semua "
"tanggung jawab aktif penyedia memiliki jalur aman."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The helper is bundled with this exact YPerf release. It does not install "
