msgstr ""
"Gerbang runtime/bidang kendali lokal sehat. WordPress Plugin Check resmi "
"tetap memerlukan penerimaan manusia eksternal dan tidak pernah direkayasa di"
" dalam YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
