msgstr ""
"Log bersifat lokal, terbatas, dan ditujukan untuk men-debug badai invalidasi"
" serta pergantian cache tak terduga."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
