msgstr ""
"Bukti native berasal dari hostname lain, sehingga YPerf tidak akan "
"mengadopsinya untuk situs ini."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr "Runtime baru yang dikelola YPerf harus lulus sebelum migrasi diselesaikan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"Runtime Acceptance berikutnya akan merekam jumlah kueri, waktu database, "
"jumlah kueri lambat, dan kelompok kueri untuk probe frontend yang dijalankan"
" di server asal."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr "Templat drop-in cache objek tidak dapat dirender dengan aman."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Penyedia lama hanya dinonaktifkan di dalam transaksi. Setelah itu YPerf "
"menyelaraskan kepemilikan, membuktikan eksekusi, menjalankan Runtime "
"Acceptance, dan otomatis memulihkan penyedia sebelumnya jika pembuktian "
"gagal."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Probe server asal saat ini membuktikan BYPASS, sehingga YPerf tidak akan "
"mengklaim akselerasi halaman."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "Operasi awal mungkin masih berjalan. Jangan jalankan lagi."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Lapisan MU portabel menyediakan perlindungan lokal bagi server asal pada "
"hosting WordPress standar. Adaptor server native dan edge dapat memperluas "
"perlindungan lebih awal di jalur permintaan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr ""
"Kumpulan permintaan setelah penerapan sedang memeriksa rute publik dan "
"kebijakan keamanan."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan tanggung jawab W3 Total Cache sebelum migrasi tidak dapat "
"dipulihkan otomatis."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
"completed."
msgstr "Profil YPerf sebelumnya dipulihkan dan Runtime Acceptance rollback selesai."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The previous YPerf settings are being restored and re-proved."
msgstr "Pengaturan YPerf sebelumnya sedang dipulihkan dan dibuktikan ulang."

msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Health "
"Check, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Penyedia sudah tidak aktif. YPerf akan mencadangkan advanced-cache.php W3TC "
