"tersebut, menjalankan Health Check, dan otomatis memulihkan file yang persis"
" jika pembuktian gagal."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Runtime "
"Acceptance, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Penyedia sudah tidak aktif. YPerf akan mencadangkan advanced-cache.php W3TC "
"tersisa yang kepemilikannya terbukti kuat, menghentikan hanya artefak "
"tersebut, menjalankan Runtime Acceptance, dan otomatis memulihkan file yang "
"persis jika pembuktian gagal."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The provider responsibility could not be retired safely."
msgstr "Tanggung jawab penyedia tidak dapat dihentikan dengan aman."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
