#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"Baseline YPerf yang dipilih telah diterapkan, diterima oleh Runtime "
"Acceptance, dan otomatis melalui pemanasan awal."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Model teks Yablonsky AI yang dipilih tidak tersedia untuk ruang kerja "
"terverifikasi ini."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Profil lokal terpilih sekarang dapat diterapkan di dalam batas WordPress "
"milik YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Cadangan pengaturan yang dipilih bukan JSON yang valid."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan hanya mengubah pengiriman dari server asal WordPress. Entri cache"
" HTML Nginx/Cloudflare eksternal yang ada memerlukan verifikasi kesegaran "
"tersendiri; YPerf tidak diam-diam melakukan purge cache host."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Cadangan pengaturan tidak berisi pengaturan YPerf portabel apa pun."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr "Cadangan pengaturan melebihi batas keamanan 256 KB yang didukung."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Situs berfungsi, tetapi cadangan kapasitas host/FPM saat ini belum "
"membuktikan ruang yang memadai untuk pekerjaan admin ketika frontend sibuk. "
"Peninjauan Origin Budget harus mempertahankan cadangan eksplisit bagi bidang"
" kendali."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Situs telah dipetakan ke pool PHP-FPM tertentu; rekomendasi Origin Budget "
"kini dapat didasarkan pada bukti."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Pool situs telah dipetakan, tetapi sampel RSS pekerja aktif tidak tersedia. "
"Jangan menyusun Origin Budget hanya dari konfigurasi."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr ""
"Diagnostik sitemap tetap berada dalam anggaran waktu eksekusinya yang "
"dibatasi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Metrik stabilitas merupakan bukti cache lokal dari server asal yang sama, "
"bukan skor Google PageSpeed. Gunakan pengujian PageSpeed berulang sebagai "
"pemeriksaan lapangan eksternal setelah YPerf membuktikan eksekusi cache "
"deterministik."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr "Drop-in cache objek yang disiapkan gagal dalam pemeriksaan hash baca ulang."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Hash artefak Page Cache tersimpan tidak cocok dengan file aktif. Penyegaran "
"diblokir."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Zona ini eksklusif untuk blok server tersebut. YPerf kini dapat menjalankan "
"pemanasan awal sementara penulisan host tetap terkunci."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Kontras tema, gaya aksesibilitas, dan skrip pihak ketiga seperti widget chat"
" berada di luar batas penulisan ini. YPerf dapat mendiagnosis biayanya "
"nanti, tetapi kampanye ini tidak menulis ulang kode eksternal hanya untuk "
"meningkatkan skor uji banding."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr ""
"Bayangkan PageSpeed Insights yang juga dapat melihat komponen teknis di "
"balik layar."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Kemampuan YPerf ini dijalankan dari alur kerja terbatas khususnya sendiri."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Migrasi yang selesai tetap terlihat dalam riwayat. Pembaruan YPerf "
"selanjutnya tidak meminta Anda memigrasikan penyedia yang sama lagi."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "File ini bukan cadangan pengaturan Yablonsky Performance yang didukung."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Gerbang ini mengubah insiden admin sesekali menjadi bukti eksplisit untuk "
"rilis dan penyetelan. Tidak pernah otomatis menaikkan memori PHP, mengubah "
"FPM, atau memodifikasi pembaru WordPress."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Indikator ini melacak konfigurasi dan bukti situs, bukan progres "
"pengembangan YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah kemampuan runtime PHP, bukan sesuatu yang seharusnya ditiru YPerf"
" di WordPress."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"Ini keunggulan utama YPerf: pekerjaan pada permintaan pertama diperlakukan "
"terpisah dari cache untuk permintaan berulang."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"Ini lapisan optimasi lokal berisiko rendah yang sengaja dipisahkan dari "
"adopsi cache dan server."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Ini terpisah dari Kesiapan Situs. Indikator ini melacak apakah penyedia lama"
" yang terdeteksi dapat dihentikan tanpa kehilangan tanggung jawab aktif."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"Inilah jawaban atas pertanyaan “apa yang benar-benar berfungsi?”. Deteksi "
"saja tidak pernah menghasilkan status AKTIF berwarna hijau."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"Ini batas penulisan lokal eksplisit pertama: YPerf hanya boleh membuat wp-"
"content/object-cache.php miliknya dan kunci kesehatan/cache Redis ber-"
"namespace di database logis yang dicadangkan."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Tanggung jawab penyedia ini tidak didukung oleh penyelesai terpandu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"Penyegaran ini hanya-baca: memeriksa ulang lingkungan, menjalankan Runtime "
"Acceptance, dan menyusun ulang uji banding kinerja. Tidak mengaktifkan "
"cache, mengubah penyedia, atau mengubah konfigurasi host."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini memiliki cukup konten terbit untuk membuat otomatisasi alur "
"penerbitan relevan. Integrasi Yablonsky Publisher di masa depan dapat "
"menggunakan bukti kinerja YPerf tanpa mengubah dasbor cache menjadi tempat "
"iklan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan tingkat situs ini melacak jalur eksekusi Redis/host-native opsional"
" dan bukti penghentian penyedia. Informasi ini tidak menjadikan fitur host "
"opsional sebagai syarat rilis pasar."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Snapshot ini hanya membuktikan sebagian susunan native. Jalankan Host "
"Inspector yang disertakan dalam rilis YPerf saat ini untuk merekam "
"kepemilikan Nginx khusus situs, isolasi/cadangan Redis, dan bukti memori "
"pekerja PHP-FPM yang tepat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Kartu ini hanya bukti. YPerf tidak mengklaim kepemilikan atas lapisan "
"runtime eksternal."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Tiga sampel frontend per rute ditambah pengujian baca localhost "
"Redis/Memcached yang terisolasi. Tidak ada pengaturan cache yang diubah."

