msgstr "YPerf tidak dapat menyiapkan drop-in cache objek sementara."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf could not verify Page Cache first, so Browser Cache was not enabled."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak dapat memverifikasi Page Cache terlebih dahulu, sehingga Browser"
" Cache tidak diaktifkan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf dashboard sections"
msgstr "Bagian dasbor YPerf"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf deliberately cannot mark its own Plugin Check green. The official "
"checker stays an independent human acceptance signal."
msgstr ""
"YPerf sengaja tidak dapat menandai Plugin Check miliknya sendiri sebagai "
"lulus. Pemeriksa resmi tetap menjadi sinyal penerimaan manusia yang "
"independen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not build a second cache. The adoption stage recognizes a fresh, "
"proven site-specific Nginx cache as the authoritative page-cache executor "
"without editing Nginx or restarting any service."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak membangun cache kedua. Tahap adopsi mengenali cache Nginx khusus"
" situs yang baru dan terbukti sebagai eksekutor cache halaman berwenang "
"tanpa mengedit Nginx atau memulai ulang layanan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not change pm.max_children, pm.max_requests or reload PHP-FPM in "
"this release."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak mengubah pm.max_children, pm.max_requests, atau memuat ulang "
"PHP-FPM dalam rilis ini."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf does not yet recognize this web-server family."
msgstr "YPerf belum mengenali keluarga server web ini."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf enables this only when Redis isolation and memory headroom are safe. "
"It is never forced just to increase a feature count."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hanya mengaktifkannya ketika isolasi Redis dan cadangan memori aman. "
"Fitur ini tidak pernah dipaksakan hanya untuk menambah jumlah fitur."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf first captures a fresh read-only baseline, then applies the selected "
"local profile and immediately repeats Runtime Acceptance. A preflight FAIL "
"makes no changes; a post-apply FAIL restores the previous profile "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf terlebih dahulu merekam baseline hanya-baca baru, kemudian menerapkan "
"profil lokal terpilih dan langsung mengulangi Runtime Acceptance. FAIL pada "
"pemeriksaan awal tidak mengubah apa pun; FAIL setelah penerapan otomatis "
"memulihkan profil sebelumnya."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has a current local reservation for the isolated Redis target. No "
"Redis key, drop-in or server configuration has been created."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki reservasi lokal terkini untuk target Redis terisolasi. Tidak "
"ada kunci Redis, drop-in, atau konfigurasi server yang dibuat."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"YPerf telah mengadopsi batas max_children PHP-FPM yang ada sebagai Origin "
"Budget situs. Tidak ada file host yang ditulis ulang karena batas native "
"saat ini sudah menegakkan ketentuan yang ditinjau."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki pool situs yang persis, bukti memori pekerja langsung, dan "
"Runtime Acceptance terkini. Ini cukup untuk meninjau Origin Budget yang "
"dibatasi, tetapi tidak cukup untuk otomatis mengubah FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki identitas pool yang persis, bukti memori pekerja langsung, "
"dan model cadangan bidang kendali. R2 membekukan keadaan awal yang ditinjau "
"dan otoritas rollback tanpa mengedit PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "YPerf sudah aktif"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hanya menerapkan pengaturan kinerja yang ada dalam daftar izin, lalu "
"membuktikannya melalui baca ulang."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mempertahankan tanggung jawab cache browser saat fitur tersebut aktif "
"pada sumber."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "YPerf mempertahankan tanggung jawab cache browser yang telah disiapkan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"YPerf sedang melakukan purge URL beranda melalui otoritas cache miliknya dan"
" jembatan purge Cloudflare yang diadopsi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hanya memulihkan pengaturan yang sebelumnya diubahnya dan tidak akan "
"menimpa perubahan eksternal yang tidak terkait."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menghangatkan kumpulan URL publik bernilai tinggi yang dibatasi agar "
"pengunjung pertama tidak menanggung biaya cache dingin."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menjaga pilihan ini tetap terlihat agar pengguna dapat memasangnya "
"atau memintanya kepada penyedia host nanti."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
"state before retrying."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak mengubah aktivasi plugin. Tinjau status kepemilikan cache "
"halaman sebelum mencoba lagi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "YPerf boleh mengubah"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hanya boleh menjalankan operasi lokal khusus dengan kontrak persis "
"yang ditampilkan di atas. Penulisan konfigurasi host masih memerlukan "
"pembantu yang ditinjau terpisah, dengan cadangan, diff persis, pengujian "
"sintaks, baca ulang, penerimaan, dan rollback."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memerlukan bukti Redis hanya-baca terkini. Sistem dapat menggunakan "
"snapshot Host Inspector terbaru atau memeriksa layanan PhpRedis lokal "
"langsung tanpa menulis kunci atau mengubah konfigurasi Redis."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "YPerf tidak pernah mengubah"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Drop-in cache objek YPerf telah dihapus. Redis tidak dikosongkan atau "
"dikonfigurasi ulang."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hanya memiliki pengaturan Rocket Loader NONAKTIF, HTTP/3 AKTIF, dan "
"sinkronisasi purge."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki lapisan yang dimigrasikan dan Runtime Acceptance setelah "
"serah terima bersih."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki tanggung jawab yang dimigrasikan dan Runtime Acceptance "
"setelah serah terima bersih."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki eksekutor cache halaman WordPress portabel, kebijakan "
"kelayakan cache, purge selektif, pemanasan awal, pembuktian eksekusi, dan "
"rollback. Cache server native tetap memiliki jalur adopsi tersendiri."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memiliki lapisan pengganti yang disiapkan. Status aktivasi plugin lain"
" tidak pernah diubah oleh YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"Cache objek persisten YPerf aktif. Pengujian bolak-balik Redis dan Runtime "
"Acceptance lulus."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan YPerf"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menyiapkan serah terima tetapi tidak akan menonaktifkan W3 Total "
"Cache. Buka Plugin, nonaktifkan sendiri W3 Total Cache, kembali ke sini, "
"lalu lanjutkan. Status aktivasi plugin tetap berada di bawah kendali Anda."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menyiapkan serah terima yang dapat dibatalkan, lalu meminta Anda "
"menonaktifkan sendiri W3 Total Cache melalui layar Plugin WordPress. Setelah"
" kembali, YPerf menyelaraskan kepemilikan, membuktikan eksekusi, dan "
"menjalankan Health Check. YPerf tidak pernah mengubah status aktivasi plugin"
" lain."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mempertahankan niat sumber untuk tetap NONAKTIF dan hanya mengaktifkan"
" Page Cache jika tanggung jawab itu memang memerlukan pengganti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"YPerf membaca konfigurasi penyedia melalui API runtime publiknya. Tidak "
"mengubah pengaturan W3TC."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr ""
"YPerf membaca pengaturan zona dan keadaan pengiriman yang benar-benar "
"berlaku."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mengakui cache Nginx FastCGI yang terbukti sebagai eksekutor cache "
"halaman berwenang. Tidak ada konfigurasi server yang diubah."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menolak menghapus advanced-cache.php karena kepemilikannya oleh W3 "
"Total Cache berubah sebelum waktu penulisan."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"Pengganti YPerf sudah siap; status aktivasi akhir plugin tetap menjadi "
"keputusan pengguna."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "Kebijakan respons YPerf aktif"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan perubahannya sendiri dan membiarkan status aktivasi plugin "
"tetap tidak berubah."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan perubahan migrasinya sendiri. Jika Anda ingin W3 Total "
"Cache aktif kembali, aktifkan sendiri melalui layar Plugin WordPress."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan perubahan migrasinya sendiri. W3 Total Cache tetap nonaktif"
" sampai administrator memilih untuk mengaktifkannya kembali melalui Plugin."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan sebagian perubahannya sendiri. Status aktivasi plugin tetap"
" berada di bawah kendali pengguna."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "YPerf memulihkan pengaturan Cloudflare yang telah diadopsinya."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan status kepemilikan sebelumnya dan berhenti sebelum menerima"
" serah terima."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memulihkan keadaan sebelumnya, mengembalikan sakelar tanggung jawab "
"W3TC yang dihentikan, dan mengaktifkan kembali W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"YPerf membatalkan setiap perubahan yang dibuat selama migrasi ini, termasuk "
"sakelar tanggung jawab W3TC sebelum serah terima."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf membatalkan sebagian serah terima dan memulihkan sakelar tanggung "
"jawab penyedia sebelum serah terima, lalu mengembalikan kendali."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "Rollback YPerf selesai."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"Rollback YPerf selesai. W3 Total Cache tidak diaktifkan kembali secara "
"otomatis; WordPress.org mengharuskan keputusan aktivasi tetap berada di "
"tangan Anda."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "Pengaturan YPerf berhasil diimpor dan diverifikasi."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf berhenti setelah mencoba rollback terlindungi, tetapi satu komponen "
"rollback tidak dapat diverifikasi. Antarmuka tidak akan mengklaim rollback "
"selesai."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"YPerf memperlakukan Redis/Valkey sebagai memori kerja terbatas dengan "
"pemantauan isolasi, maxmemory, hit/miss, dan eviction."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"YPerf menggunakan namespace khusus situs dan invalidasi cache berbasis "
"generasi agar rollback tidak memerlukan penghapusan data Redis yang tidak "
"terkait."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak akan mengaktifkan Page Cache portabelnya selama eksekutor native"
" yang diadopsi memegang otoritas cache halaman. Tinjau atau lepaskan adopsi "
"itu lebih dahulu jika sengaja ingin mengganti eksekutor."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak akan mengubah advanced-cache.php yang kepemilikannya belum "
"terbukti."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak akan mengaktifkan cache kueri database hanya untuk menambah "
"jumlah fitur. Manfaat terukur harus terbukti bersama cache objek dan indeks "
"database yang nyata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
"mode, workspace header and Writer transport all pass the local contract "
"gate."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tidak akan mengirim kredensial sebelum endpoint HTTPS, mode "
"autentikasi, header ruang kerja, dan transport Penulis semuanya lulus "
"pemeriksaan kontrak lokal."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf will preserve cart, checkout, account and session bypass rules."
msgstr "YPerf akan mempertahankan aturan bypass keranjang, checkout, akun, dan sesi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will save the exact local diff and the post-apply Runtime Acceptance "
"result."
msgstr ""
"YPerf akan menyimpan diff lokal yang persis dan hasil Runtime Acceptance "
"setelah penerapan."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "YPerf-owned replacement responsibilities were activated and proved."
msgstr "Tanggung jawab pengganti milik YPerf telah diaktifkan dan dibuktikan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YSEO"
msgstr "YSEO"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI API Key"
msgstr "Kunci API Yablonsky AI"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI account verification failed. Check the API key and try again."
msgstr "Verifikasi akun Yablonsky AI gagal. Periksa kunci API dan coba lagi."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI account verification is not available under the reviewed "
"service contract."
msgstr ""
"Verifikasi akun Yablonsky AI tidak tersedia berdasarkan kontrak layanan yang"
" ditinjau."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI can analyze privacy-minimized YPerf evidence and recommend one "
"allowed local profile. AI never owns execution: deterministic safety gates "
"and your explicit Apply remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky AI dapat menganalisis bukti YPerf dengan data pribadi yang "
"diminimalkan dan merekomendasikan satu profil lokal yang diizinkan. AI tidak"
" mengendalikan eksekusi: gerbang keamanan deterministik dan tindakan "
"Terapkan yang Anda setujui tetap berwenang."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection settings saved."
msgstr "Pengaturan koneksi Yablonsky AI disimpan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection verified."
msgstr "Koneksi Yablonsky AI terverifikasi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI connection verified. The current workspace is ready for "
"explicit AI requests."
msgstr ""
"Koneksi Yablonsky AI terverifikasi. Ruang kerja saat ini siap untuk "
"permintaan AI yang eksplisit."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI could not open a model-specific analysis session."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI tidak dapat membuka sesi analisis khusus model."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI credit balances"
msgstr "Saldo kredit Yablonsky AI"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI only"
msgstr "Hanya Yablonsky AI"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI or local Autopilot"
msgstr "Yablonsky AI atau Autopilot Lokal"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI request was blocked because the instruction was empty."
msgstr "Permintaan Yablonsky AI diblokir karena instruksinya kosong."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned a response that could not be validated."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI mengembalikan respons yang tidak dapat divalidasi."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI returned an account response that did not match the reviewed "
"User API shape."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky AI mengembalikan respons akun yang tidak cocok dengan struktur "
"User API yang ditinjau."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned an unsuccessful model-specific response."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI mengembalikan respons khusus model yang gagal."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned an unsuccessful response."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI mengembalikan respons yang gagal."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned no usable Writer text."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI tidak mengembalikan teks Penulis yang dapat digunakan."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
